  "question": "What park are located west of Crave Golf Club, Pigeon Forge, TN within a 130 kilometers radius?",
  "sql": "\nWITH origin AS  (SELECT ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-83.564838 35.797212)',4326)::geography AS geometry)\nSELECT * FROM pois, origin\nWHERE ST_DWithin(pois.geometry, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-83.564838 35.797212)',4326)::geography, 130000)\nAND leisure = 'park'\nAND degrees(ST_Azimuth(origin.geometry, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN 247.5 AND 292.5;\n",
